
### `.gitignore`



```gitignore
# Operating system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE / editor files
.vscode/
.idea/

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# Node / JavaScript tooling
node_modules/

# Python tooling
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Environment variables
.env
.env.*

# Build / distribution files
dist/
build/

# Coverage
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Local development files
*.local

# Archives
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz